```ejs
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>Technician Application Update - GridCare</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f4f7f9;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #333333;
    }

    .email-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 40px 0;
      background-color: #f4f7f9;
    }

    .email-container {
      width: 90%;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    .header {
      padding: 28px 30px;
      background-color: #0f766e;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .header p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: #dff7f5;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 35px 30px;
    }

    .content h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #222222;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .content p {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #555555;
    }

    .rejection-box {
      margin: 25px 0;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #fff5f5;
      border-left: 4px solid #dc2626;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .rejection-box h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #b91c1c;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .rejection-box p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #555555;
    }

    .reason-box {
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 15px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #eeeeee;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .reason-box strong {
      color: #333333;
    }

    .footer {
      padding: 22px 30px;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
      color: #777777;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .brand {
      color: #0f766e;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">

    <div class="email-container">

      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header">
        <h1>GridCare</h1>
        <p>Technician Application Update</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content -->
      <div class="content">

        <h2>Hello <%= name %>,</h2>

        <p>
          Thank you for your interest in joining
          <span class="brand">GridCare</span> as a technician.
        </p>

        <p>
          We have carefully reviewed your technician application.
          Unfortunately, we are unable to approve your application at this time.
        </p>

        <!-- Rejection Notice -->
        <div class="rejection-box">
          <h3>Application Not Approved</h3>

          <p>
            Your technician application has been rejected based on the
            information and documents submitted during the application process.
          </p>

          <% if (reason) { %>
            <div class="reason-box">
              <strong>Reason:</strong>

              <p>
                <%= reason %>
              </p>
            </div>
          <% } %>
        </div>

        <p>
          If you believe there has been an error or you would like to provide
          additional information, please contact the GridCare support team.
        </p>

        <p>
          You may be able to submit a new application in the future with
          updated or additional information.
        </p>

        <p>
          Thank you for your time and interest in GridCare.
        </p>

        <p>
          Regards,<br />
          <strong>GridCare Team</strong>
        </p>

      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">
        <p>
          This is an automated email from <span class="brand">GridCare</span>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Please do not reply directly to this email.
        </p>

        <p>
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> GridCare. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
```
